Package: OmixMOSuite
Type: Package
Title: MOObject Data Bridge for OMIX
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Margaret", "Cam", email = "maggie.cam@nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Converts MOObject multiOmicDataSet objects into portable OMIX
    counts-plus-metadata or continuous-expression-plus-metadata contracts.
    The package retains its original OmixMOSuite name and public count
    functions for compatibility but depends only on the lightweight MOObject
    object package, not the MOSuite analysis package.
